WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.455 --> 00:00:01.240
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:02.180
We are Pongfinity!

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.180
Since the launch of our first mobile game

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.580
There's been hundreds of requests

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.220
To make an online multiplayer game

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.280
So, here it finally is!

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.120
The Pongfinity Duels!

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:15.260
It's free to download on both Apple and Android devices

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.320
And it's developed by our friend Johannes Linnama

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:19.540
Who also made the first Pongfinity game

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.380
The coolest feature of the game

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.080
Is that you can play against other players

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.260
Or challenge your friends in a private game

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:26.600
And if you're lucky

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.100
You might even get to play a duel against one of us!

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:31.100
There's 17 different special shots

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.260
that you can choose from to surprise your opponent

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.520
And you can also do sidespin shots!

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.240
The games are to 5 points

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:39.680
With a 2 point difference

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:40.820
Let's play a game!

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:41.240
Ready?

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.380
I'm ready!

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:43.440
I'm gonna beat you!

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:48.320
One of the best things in this game is that there are spins...

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.500
Ooh! What a...!

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.060
What was that!?

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.800
That was my special shot!

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:54.360
Cannonball!

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.140
Ooh! Did you see that serve!?

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.280
Neither one is giving up easily

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.680
Wow! How did you get it?

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:05.060
Ooooh! You got that as well!

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:08.000
This is a crazy rally!

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.300
It's never ending!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:11.580
No!

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:19.800
I have to get this one

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:22.220
Nooo! I went to the wrong side!

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:22.920
Nooo!

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:28.560
No, why did I go...

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:30.300
4-4!

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:32.720
- Come on!
- I was there! But then I left...

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.180
Yes!! I got it!

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:40.740
Ok now wait for it Otto!

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.080
Wait for the special move!

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.660
It's my advantage!

00:01:46.240 --> 00:01:47.200
Yes!!!

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:48.260
Got it!!

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.540
Yes!

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.700
5-... no it's continuing!

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:53.940
It's actually continuing!

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:58.260
Aah, that was a really bad snake!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:01:59.440
Yea, that was

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:02.140
Adam Bobrow wouldn't be happy with that

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.560
And that's the victory!

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:08.320
- 6-4!
- Good match!

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:09.800
As you saw there

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:11.880
This is so intense!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:14.860
You don't even realize it's getting so intense!

00:02:15.260 --> 00:02:17.600
Download it for free in the links in the description

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:18.800
And challenge your friends!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:20.140
Until next time!

